<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" http-equiv="Content-Type" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <h1>Your account has been created!</h1>

    <p>You have been registered as a user for <strong><%= @user.tenant&.name || "SPOS" %></strong>.</p>

    <p>Here are your login credentials:</p>

    <table style="background-color: #f3f4f6; border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px; margin: 16px 0; width: 100%;">
      <tr>
        <td style="padding: 4px 8px; font-weight: bold;">Email:</td>
        <td style="padding: 4px 8px;"><%= @user.email %></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="padding: 4px 8px; font-weight: bold;">Password:</td>
        <td style="padding: 4px 8px;"><%= @password %></td>
      </tr>
    </table>

    <p>Please log in and change your password after your first login.</p>

    <p>Thank you!</p>
  </body>
</html>
